<title>AUSTRIA: Qatar expects a six month OPEC output rollover.</title>
<headline>Qatar expects a six month OPEC output rollover.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatari oil minister Abdullah bin Hamad al-Attiyah said he expected OPEC to rollover its output ceiling for the next six months</p>
<p>&quot;I think the same period as last time,&quot; he told reporters as he left for the full ministerial session scheduled to start at 1400 gmt.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
